OL,3,GNEWSATeen drove at about 90mph before
OL,4,Afatal river crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree passengers survived and, via a
OL,7,Fstatement read in court in Huntingdon,
OL,8,Fone of them said Berry had been driving
OL,9,Fat about 90mph moments before the
OL,10,Fincident, and when he asked him to
OL,11,F"slow down", Berry replied "we will be
OL,12,Ffine".
